                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "100% Tick Tock Bang Bang on 7/7/2016. A game that is built around being a movie star and doing amazing stunts and combat in Slo-Mo. Control the speed of the game as you progress through bullet-hell style levels. Admittedly the game isn't that long, but it does have a lot of fun mechanics for the time that it was played. There is a level creator but I didn't really spend much time in that. Still fun for what it was.",
